<CaseStudyLayout title="The Margin" category="Learning Experience Design" subtitle="Designing judgment under ambiguity">
  <div slot="hero">
    <p>An interactive field journal that helps early-career professionals practice calibrated autonomy: deciding when to proceed, investigate, modify, or escalate as conditions change.</p>
